Product Catalog Summary
======================

Sample products from books.toscrape.com:






            declare variable $content as node() external;

            for $product at $i in $content//article[@class="product_pod"][position() <= 5]
            return concat($i, ". ", normalize-space($product//h3/a/@title), " - ", normalize-space($product//p[@class="price_color"]))
